# The public keys that sign Fogata's releases (SHA256SUMS) and release tags, in the format of
# ssh-keygen's ALLOWED SIGNERS:
#   fogata-release namespaces="file,git" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...     the SSH key of public releases
#                                                                 (docs/releasing.md)
#   fogata-prerelease namespaces="file" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...      a pre-release key, as
#                                                                 `fogata release keygen` prints it
#                                                                 (docs/releasing-beta.md)
# The two names keep them apart: `ssh-keygen -Y verify -I fogata-release` takes no pre-release
# key. `python3 tools/release.py verify <folder>` checks SHA256SUMS.sig against the
# fogata-release lines here, and `verify --prerelease` against the fogata-prerelease ones.
